ician Services Deficiencies","concept":"staffing","concept_label":"Staffing & supervision"},"cms-f0561":{"code":"F-0561","title":"Honor the resident's right to and the facility must promote and facilitate resident self-determination through support of resident choice.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0842":{"code":"F-0842","title":"Safeguard resident-identifiable information and/or maintain medical records on each resident that are in accordance with accepted professional standards.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0689":{"code":"F-0689","title":"Ensure that a nursing home area is free from accident hazards and provides adequate supervision to prevent accidents.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0809":{"code":"F-0809","title":"Ensure meals and snacks are served at times in accordance with resident’s needs, preferences, and requests.  Suitable and nourishing alternative meals and snacks must be provided for residents who want to eat at non-traditional times or outside of scheduled meal times.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0812":{"code":"F-0812","title":"Procure food from sources approved or considered satisfactory and store, prepare, distribute and serve food in accordance with professional standards.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0880":{"code":"F-0880","title":"Provide and implement an infection prevention and control program.","category":"Infection Control Deficiencies","concept":"infection_prevention","concept_label":"Infection prevention"},"cms-e0007":{"code":"E-0007","title":"Address patient/client population and determine types of services needed.","category":"Emergency Preparedness Deficiencies","concept":"emergency_preparedness","concept_label":"Emergency preparedness"},"cms-k0353":{"code":"K-0353","title":"Inspect, test, and maintain automatic sprinkler systems.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0712":{"code":"K-0712","title":"Have simulated fire drills held at unexpected times.","category":"Miscellaneous Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0918":{"code":"K-0918","title":"Have generator or other power source capable of supplying service within 10 seconds.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0211":{"code":"K-0211","title":"Keep aisles, corridors, and exits free of obstruction in case of emergency.","category":"Egress Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0741":{"code":"K-0741","title":"Have posted \"No-smoking\" signs in areas where smoking is not permitted or ashtrays provided where smoking was allowed.","category":"Miscellaneous Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0802":{"code":"F-0802","title":"Provide sufficient support personnel to safely and effectively carry out the functions of the food and nutrition service.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0584":{"code":"F-0584","title":"Honor the resident's right to a safe, clean, comfortable and homelike environment, including but not limited to receiving treatment and supports for daily living safely.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f063